# Copy to your local agent/runtime environment and fill in values there.
# Never commit real credentials.

# Google Drive OAuth token file (authorized-user JSON) used by the research-wiki tools
# (research_scan.py and scan_triage_apply.py). On the VPS this is
# /root/.hermes/google_token.json; all tools accept --token-path to override.
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_FILE=/path/to/google_token.json

# Drive state-folder IDs and run-output paths are data, not secrets. They live in
# scripts/research-wiki-tools/scan_config.py; folder location is the human-readable
# workflow state (`pending`, `wiki`, `read-once`, or `discarded`).
